Thought: The search results for the SMILES string "C1=C(C=C(C=C1C=O)O)CC(=O)O" do not match the proton NMR data either. I will try another isomer from the list. Next, I will search for the SMILES "COC(=O)C1=CC=C(O1)C=CC=O" to see if it matches the NMR data.
